sequenceDiagram
  actor user as "Team Member<br/>[Person]"
  box rgba(17,104,189,0.12) bwyn (Software System boundary)
    participant tab as "PracticesTab<br/>[Component: React]"
    participant client as "PracticesClient<br/>[Component: TypeScript]"
    participant controller as "PracticesController<br/>[Component: Spring MVC]"
    participant handler as "PracticesQueryHandler<br/>[Component: Spring Boot]"
    participant adapter as "PracticesQueryAdapter<br/>[Component: Spring Data JPA]"
  end
  participant db as "PostgreSQL<br/>[External Software System]"

  user->>tab: Opens Practices tab
  tab->>tab: Shows loading state
  tab->>client: Fetches practices
  client->>controller: GET /api/practices
  controller->>handler: Executes PracticesQuery
  handler->>adapter: Loads groups and practices
  adapter->>db: Queries practice_group and practice
  db-->>adapter: Returns rows in display order
  adapter-->>handler: Returns read models
  handler-->>controller: Returns PracticesResult
  controller-->>client: 200 OK with groups and practices
  client-->>tab: Returns mapped PracticeGroup list
  tab-->>user: Renders two groups and fourteen practices

  alt backend unreachable or error
    controller-->>client: Error response
    client-->>tab: Signals load failure
    tab-->>user: Shows error with Try Again button
  end
